"""
`Ship6DOF.Propeller1Q` with the parameter file `presets/Propeller/wageningen_b4_70.toml`: a Wageningen
B-series screw with 4 blades, expanded blade area ratio 0.7, pitch-diameter ratio 0.8
and a diameter of 6.0 m; a wider-bladed four-blade screw at a lower pitch ratio.

The file sets only `Z`, `Ae_Ao`, `P_D` and `Diameter`. The open-water thrust and torque
coefficients are not in the file: they are computed by `Ship6DOF.Propeller1Q` from the
B-series regression polynomials (Oosterveld & van Oossanen, 1975) at these three
ratios, inside that regression's stated range (2 to 7 blades, area ratio 0.30 to 1.05,
pitch ratio 0.5 to 1.4). The diameter is an example scale, not a value from the
publication. Hull-dependent parameters (wake fraction, thrust deduction, relative
rotative efficiency) keep the defaults of `Propeller1Q`. Provenance is recorded next to
the file in `wageningen_b4_70.provenance.toml`.

A thin wrapper with no equations of its own: it extends the one `Propeller1Q` and
loads the file with an `apply` clause on that `extends` clause. Change a
value by editing a copy of the file or by using `Propeller1Q` directly.
"""
component WageningenB4_70Propeller
  extends DyadShip.Ship6DOF.Propeller1Q(apply "dyad://DyadShip/presets/Propeller/wageningen_b4_70.toml")
end
